    "The complete retained ansi_files.c contains five routines at 0x80121EEC..0x801221EC. The next routine begins atof/decimal arithmetic source, beyond this family.",
    "The __files object is four 80-byte FILE structures (stdin, stdout, stderr, empty). Its 320-byte size is already correctly identified centrally.",
    "Three 256-byte BSS buffers are emitted in reverse source declaration order: stderr_buff at 0x8033D388, stdout_buff at 0x8033D488, stdin_buff at 0x8033D588. No padding is owned by this unit.",
